algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: TropicalMatMul(A, B, n)
Input: n×n matrices A, B over ℝ ∪ {−∞}
Output: n×n matrix C = A ⊗ B

for i = 0 to n-1:
    for j = 0 to n-1:
        C[i][j] = −∞
        for k = 0 to n-1:
            C[i][j] = max(C[i][j], A[i][k] + B[k][j])
return C

Complexity: Time O(n³), Space O(n²)
